The `portainer_light` integration is a derivative work focused on a narrower
use case: exposing Docker Swarm services as replica sensors with a single
`scale_service` action. Significant portions of the configuration flow,
coordinator, and service handling were inspired by — and in some cases
adapted from — the original Home Assistant `portainer` integration.

